        <DemoExample Title="ZIndex" RazorCode="@example7RazorCode" Id="example7">
            <div class="example-desc">
                A sticky element keeps a z-index of 1, enough to pass over the plain flowing content it
                sticks above without covering the popups and overlays of the rest of the page. Where
                positioned content in the same container carries a higher stacking order, <b>ZIndex</b>
                raises the sticky element above it - in the first container below the sticky passes under
                the positioned box, in the second one its <b>ZIndex</b> lifts it over.
            </div>
